WEBVTT

NOTE
Missiles in flight. A single missile streaks through clouds, then multiple missiles converge on their target.

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Clouds rush past. The camera races through the sky at high speed.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
A missile streaks through the cloud layer, flame trail blazing behind it.

00:08.000 --> 00:11.000
Multiple missiles converge, their smoke trails crossing as they close on the target.
